<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley on Latam retailers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley on Latam retailers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said analyst Julio Zamora initiated coverage of five Latin American retailers on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Cifra SA de CV was rated strong buy. There was no trade in the stock.</p>
<p>-- Disco SA was rated strong buy. The stock was up 1/2 at 43-7/8 in New York morning trade.  </p>
<p>-- Organizacion Soriana SA de CV was rated strong buy. The stock was up 0.25 at 23.25 in Mexico morning trade.</p>
<p>-- Grupo Elektra SA de CV was rated neutral. The stock was down 1/4 at 26-1/2 in New York trade.</p>
<p>-- Lojas Renner SA was rated neutral. There was no trade in the stock.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
